==Early entrants==
===College underclassmen===
For the tenth year in a row and the fourteenth time in fifteen years, no college underclassman would withdraw their entry into the NBA draft. Not only that, but this would also be the first year since [[1985 NBA draft|1985]] where no underclassmen playing overseas would enter the NBA draft and would be the first draft since [[1986 NBA draft|1986]] with no foreign-born underclassmen as well. This year would see a total of sixteen college underclassmen entering the draft. The following [[college basketball]] players successfully applied for early draft entrance.<ref>{{cite web |title=1992 Underclassmen |url=https://www.thedraftreview.com/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=3039:1992-underclassmen&catid=136&Itemid=384 |website=The Draft Review | date=August 4, 2007 |access-date=December 15, 2022}}</ref>

